('APX-S-5034-2', 'APX-C-5034', 2, null, null, null, 'If ''@Reference Image'' is live-action, the output should be live-action; if it is an illustration, the output should be an illustration. Maintain the protagonist''s face, hairstyle, vibe, and silhouette. Include a solo highlight for the protagonist, and in the middle or latter half, have four friends of the same gender naturally join in to dance as a five-person unit. All four friends must be distinct types and not copies of the protagonist, though the unit should have a sense of unity.', null, null, 'Maintain the protagonist''s face, hairstyle, vibe, and silhouette. Include a solo highlight for the protagonist, and in the middle or latter half, have four friends of the same gender naturally join in to dance as a five-person unit.', 'family', null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-5034-3', 'APX-C-5034', 3, null, null, null, 'Costumes should match the theme and location you''ve designed, such as idol-style, K-pop style, dance MV outfits, or the outfit from ''@Reference Image''. The four friends should wear similar, color-coordinated, or unified costumes. Ideally, they should wear color variations of the protagonist''s outfit. You may include natural costume changes if needed, such as when switching locations. The dance should be a professional performance naturally mixing K-pop, street, and cool Latin styles based on hip-hop.', null, null, 'Ideally, they should wear color variations of the protagonist''s outfit.', 'family', null, null, null, null, null),
