('APX-S-5034-5', 'APX-C-5034', 5, null, null, null, 'You don''t need to stick to these, but use frequent random scene transitions. Never use ''@Reference Image'' as the first frame. Never use the background of ''@Reference Image''. NEGATIVE: Protagonist becomes a different person, friends become copies, too many or too few people, unnatural face or limbs, low resolution, blurriness, noise, camera angles that hide the dancing, background too prominent, costume glitches, repetitive movements, mismatch between dance and music, anime style for live-action input, or live-action style for illustration input.', null, null, 'You don''t need to stick to these, but use frequent random scene transitions. NEGATIVE: Protagonist becomes a different person, friends become copies, too many or too few people, unnatural face or limbs, low resolution, blurriness, noise…', 'family', null, null, null, null, null),
