('APX-S-4927-1', 'APX-C-4927', 1, null, null, null, null, 1, 2019, 'Panel 1: waking up in a modern apartment bedroom with soft sunrise window light, casual comfortable sleepwear, calm morning mood Panel 2: washing face in a minimalist bathroom sink with water splashes and mirror reflections Panel 3:…', null, 'sprinting; biting; feasting', null, null, 'apartment, gym, bedroom, bathroom', 'intense')
